<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Your Medical Prescription - HealthNest</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #334155;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .header {
      background: #0d9488;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .header p {
      margin: 4px 0 0 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 28px 24px;
    }
    .card {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-left: 4px solid #0d9488;
    }
    .card table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }
    .card td {
      padding: 6px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .card td.label {
      color: #64748b;
      width: 40%;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .card td.value {
      color: #0f172a;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #f8fafc;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>HealthNest</h1>
      <p>Digital Healthcare Consultation</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0;">Dear <strong><%= patientName %></strong>,</p>

      <p>Your online medical consultation with <strong>Dr. <%= doctorName %></strong> has been completed.</p>

      <p>Your official medical prescription has been generated and is attached to this email as a PDF document for your records.</p>

      <div class="card">
        <table>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">Attending Doctor:</td>
            <td class="value">Dr. <%= doctorName %></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">Prescription ID:</td>
            <td class="value"><%= prescriptionId %></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">Appointment Ref:</td>
            <td class="value"><%= appointmentId %></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">Issue Date:</td>
            <td class="value"><%= date %></td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">
        Please review the attached PDF for complete medication details, dosages, and specific clinical advice. If you experience adverse reactions or have questions, please reach out to your doctor immediately.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 4px 0;">&copy; <%= year %> HealthNest. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p style="margin: 0;">This is an automated email. For support, contact <%= supportEmail %></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

